{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277190/extras/6d60f29e399a1f976eb7a92470983823.avif?t=1619052792\" width=640 height=128 /></span><br><br>How To Make A Killing is an open-world action RPG where choices are permanent and ripple through the world around you. The small town of Hamelin is under the threat of a young necromancer, but how you interact with characters, where you go, and how you go about being an assassin who does assassin things is up to you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277190/extras/7e9fdde34bf701f027b54975965ff757.avif?t=1619052792\" width=640 height=128 /></span><br><br>How To Make A Killing brings the old-school style game into a dark and morally complicated world with cults, addictive-substances, and complicated characters with unique and branching stories. <br><br>How to Make a Killing Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open world exploration and action RPG combat<br></li><li>Consequence-driven quests and dialogue choices<br></li><li>13 side quests and 20 unique enemies<br></li><li>28 items with a variety of uses and story implications<br></li><li>Inventive puzzles that blend player abilities with in-game objects<br></li><li>Throwing knives, invisibility cloaks, lightning, and more<br></li><li>Murder<br></li><li>And rabbits</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277190/extras/0d39ff8ecca7ebd1280a1ae53d28d36f.avif?t=1619052792\" width=640 height=128 /></span><br><br>In Hamelin, every choice is permanent, which means you can\u2019t just hack and slash your way through quests like you would in a purely linear ARPG. Your choices have consequences, shaping the world and impacting events yet to come.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Kill someone? They're dead.<br></li><li>Steal something? It's stolen.<br></li><li>Say something? You said it.<br></li><li>Talk to a rabbit? Live with things that you can\u2019t unhear.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277190/extras/7ac10f6f22b444cec47aca42b203fdd5.avif?t=1619052792\" width=640 height=128 /></span><br><br>Rabbits fill the world of How to Make a Killing, and they are just as willing to kill you as they are to share what\u2019s on their mind. Will you trust the rabbits? Will you endure hearing the sordid details of their private lives? Will you take their advice in the tutorial? Will your sword be enough to fend them off when they attack?","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"4d418b5d78a883fb4dbedcc00c00c61d7ca5aa1c.jpg","localized_name":"Can you Dig it?","name":"Can you Dig it?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1277190/4d418b5d78a883fb4dbedcc00c00c61d7ca5aa1c.jpg"},{"icon":"108813c19641742393922a0a699e0f0c82f64c00.jpg","localized_name":"Falchion Sword","name":"Falchion Sword","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1277190/108813c19641742393922a0a699e0f0c82f64c00.jpg"},{"icon":"3d3fb8eefa861e5a109be52f0b55f7bd358186e9.jpg","localized_name":"Loot Goblin","name":"Loot Goblin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1277190/3d3fb8eefa861e5a109be52f0b55f7bd358186e9.jpg"},{"icon":"e3657f5e2d75cd8db6d79d976bb7875d2ca8df78.jpg","localized_name":"Snack Attack","name":"Snack Attack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1277190/e3657f5e2d75cd8db6d79d976bb7875d2ca8df78.jpg"},{"icon":"c30e02725d9978c9c8533f0968fc817212ba53ec.jpg","localized_name":"My Dear Rockson.","name":"My Dear Rockson.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1277190/c30e02725d9978c9c8533f0968fc817212ba53ec.jpg"},